COMMENT ON TABLE iam.user_account IS E'Anonymisation blanks PII but keeps the id, so every historical reference survives.\n\nSource/critical constraints:\n- ux_user_username (WHERE anonymised_at IS NULL)\n- ux_user_phone\n\npgModeler-native representation: username and email are stored as text. Username comparison remains trimmed + case-insensitive through ux_user_username_normalized; customer email is not unique. Anonymisation preserves immutable User ID.';
