COMMENT ON TABLE tournament.tournament_resource IS E'Exactly 1 to 4 historical assignment rows. Snapshots are immutable. Player-hosted Venue Accept replaces the immutable Approval Hold with a new standard Tournament Hold and updates reservation_id once. ACTIVE Resource loss is a one-way removed_at/removal_cause write and never changes stored Tournament cost.';
