COMMENT ON TABLE notification.notification_delivery IS E'Worker-only mutation. PENDING/FAILED -> SENT | FAILED | DEAD_LETTER (attempt +1). SENT is terminal. DEAD_LETTER is terminal except the explicit audited Admin recovery (-> PENDING). SMS only for OTP-class catalogue codes.\n\nSource/critical constraints:\n- ux_delivery_once (notification_id, channel)';
