);
-- ddl-end --
COMMENT ON TABLE notification.venue_push_subscription IS E'v1.1.27: Venue Dashboard Web Push subscriptions (Product Owner decision A6: live + Web Push + audible alert). One row per browser subscription of a Venue Account. Lifecycle: registered -> seen (last_seen_at only moves forward) -> revoked (terminal); endpoint and keys are immutable; an endpoint may be active for at most one row.';
